    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d457">

                <pb facs="0630" n="622" sameAs="frus:frus1941v04/pg622"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.94/2540<hi rendition="#superscript">20/36</hi>
                </note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Chief of the Division of Far Eastern
                        Affairs</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Hamilton</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-11-19">November 19, 1941</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary</hi>: There is attached a revision of
                    the proposal which was sent to you by Mr. Morgenthau.<anchor n="50"
                        xml:id="d457-f1"/> (The proposal still of course needs further revision and
                    elaboration.)</p>
                <p>I think that the proposal is the most constructive one which I have yet seen. I
                    have shown the proposal to all of the senior officers of FE, and all of them
                    concur in that view.</p>
                <pb facs="0631" n="623" xml:id="pg623"/>
                <p>I urge that most careful consideration be given promptly to the proposal. To that
                    end I suggest that copies of the proposal be made available to Admiral Stark and
                    to General Marshall and that you arrange to confer with them in regard to the
                    matter as soon as they have had an opportunity to examine the proposal.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>M[<hi rendition="#small-caps">axwell</hi>] M. H[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">amilton</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d457-a1.xml" xpointer="d457-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
